# Knob corners and odd notes: P1/P2 at 0 and 255 on a closed hat, an open hat, a crash and the bell; MIDI 0 and
# 127 (keys 4 and 3 at octaves -3 and +3, clamped to +-2); octave presses -2 and +2 (notes 5 and 101); velocity 1;
# the swell at P2 255 (a 3.6 s rise).
tempo 120
steps 64
tail 6.0
track perc
param p1 0 0
param p2 0 0
note 0 F3 1 127
note 1 A3 1 127
note 2 A4 1 127
note 3 E5 1 127
param p1 255 4
param p2 255 4
note 4 F3 1 127
note 6 A3 1 127
param p1 0 12
param p2 255 12
note 12 A4 1 127
param p1 255 20
param p2 0 20
note 20 E5 1 127
param p1 128 24
param p2 128 24
note 24 0 1 127
note 25 127 1 127
note 26 5 1 127
note 27 101 1 127
note 28 A3 1 1
track sample
param p1 128 0
param p2 255 0
note 32 Eb5 1 127
expect sound 0 64
expect idle 150
expect peak_below -6
